    {
      "blockIndex": 33,
      "sourceBlockId": "block_117",
      "sourceUnitId": null,
      "sourceText": "Example: Abbadon's Subtlety ends the turn after dealing Damage. If this Damage was dealt, the target taking this damage could use any Actions or Abilities they have to prevent this damage, redirect this damage, or otherwise finish reacting before the turn ends.",
